    "properties": {
        "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "analyzer": "my_custom_analyzer"
        }
    }
}

es.indices.put_mapping(index=index_name, body=mappings)
```

### Step 4: Optimize Search Fields

To optimize search fields for improved relevance, you can use synonyms, stop words, and other linguistic features.

```python
# Add synonyms
