By setting up specific alert thresholds in Grafana for log volume spikes, you can ensure that you are promptly notified of any unusual increases in log volume. This proactive approach helps you manage and mitigate potential issues before they become critical. Regularly review and adjust your alert thresholds based on your system's normal behavior and performance needs.

