You can run Logstash with multiple configuration files using the `--config` option. Each configuration file will run as a separate pipeline.

```sh
logstash --config.pipeline_workers=4 --config.reload.automatic --config.pipeline.id=pipeline1 --config.pipeline.batch.size=125 --config.pipeline.batch.delay=5 --config.pipeline.config=/path/to/pipeline1.conf &
logstash --config.pipeline_workers=4 --config.reload.automatic --config.pipeline.id=pipeline2 --config.pipeline.batch.size=125 --config.pipeline.batch.delay=5 --config.pipeline.config=/path/to/pipeline2.conf &
