   ```hcl
   terraform {
     backend "s3" {
       bucket = "my-terraform-state-storage"
       key    = "path/to/statefile.tfstate"
       region = "us-west-2"
     }
   }
   ```

3. **Initialize Terraform with the Remote State Backend**

