Consider using lifecycle management to handle instance termination and replacement.

### 7. Add Error Handling and Retry Mechanisms
Implement retry mechanisms to handle transient errors.

### 8. Use Outputs for Better Visibility
Use outputs to display important information about the deployed instances.

### Improved Terraform Configuration

Here's an improved version of your Terraform configuration incorporating these suggestions:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_security_group" "example_sg" {
  name        = "example_sg"
  description = "Security group for example instances"

  ingress {
    from_port   = 22
    to_port     = 22
    protocol    = "tcp"
    cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
